first_shard:{speaker:'Cassian Valen',portraitFaction:'Mercians',pre:'A Worldshard has awakened beyond the Aurel road. Before we decide what it means, you need to learn how to survive around it. Keep a creature Ready if you need its protection.',post:'You felt it, did you not? The Shard reacted to the battle. Eryndor is calling to more than one people now.',objectives:[{t:'win',label:'Win the battle'},{t:'hp',v:20,label:'Finish with 20+ Leader HP'},{t:'round',v:7,label:'Win by Round 7'}],tutorialSteps:[{title:'Read a Card',text:'The gem is Energy cost. Creature cards also show Attack and Health. Your tutorial opening hand is fixed so the lesson is predictable.'},{title:'Keep This Hand',text:'Normal matches allow one mulligan. For this lesson, keep these cards and tap Confirm Mulligan.'},{title:'Your Goal',text:'Reduce the opposing Leader to 0 Health. Ready creatures form the Frontline and protect that Leader.'}]},
pack_trail:{speaker:'Kharra Redclaw',portraitFaction:'Mahirim',pre:'A lone hunter is prey. A pack chooses the shape of the hunt. Show me whether your warriors know how to move together.',post:'You did not freeze when the pack closed around you. Good. Raukhyr remembers courage.',objectives:[{t:'win',label:'Win the battle'},{t:'round',v:8,label:'Win by Round 8'},{t:'hp',v:12,label:'Finish with 12+ Leader HP'}]},
